  "description": "High-performance B+Tree index engine for .NET.\n    Works with MemoryStream or FileStream, fixed-size pages, and deterministic memory use.\n    Suitable for embedded systems, POS terminals, kiosks, scanners, and edge devices.\n    Supports balanced insert/erase, leaf-chain traversal, and deferred flush write-back caching.\n    Ideal for KV stores, embedded storage engines, OLTP index tables, queue logs, and append-only logs.",
  "iconFile": "btree.png",
